:: Photo High Start
<<effects>>

<<photo_init>>
Niki collects <<his>> equipment, and leads you to <<his>> car. It's parked across the road. You climb inside.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Photo High Suit]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>

:: Photo High Suit
<<set $location to "town">><<set $bus to "high">><<effects>>

Niki drives you to High Street, and stops outside the intended shop. You see board games, card games, and computer games on display through the windows. They boast an impressive variety.
<br><br>

You enter the shop with Niki. Staff seem to be expecting <<him>>, and spare only a glance as you follow <<him>> into the back rooms.
<br><br>

<<He>> approaches a rack of clothes, and pulls out one item in particular. A huge, bulky costume that resembles a monstrous villain from a popular franchise.
<br><br>

"I'll wait outside," <<he>> says. <<He>> hands you the costume, then leaves the room.
<br><br>

The costume is heavier than it looks. Its thick material stretches enough for you to climb in through the open mouth.

<<if Weather.temperature gte 25>>
	You suspect it will be horribly warm, especially in this heat.
<<elseif Weather.temperature lte 0>>
	You suspect it will be uncomfortably warm, even with how cold it is outside.
<<else>>
	You suspect it will be uncomfortably warm.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Wear the costume over your clothes|Photo High Suit 2]]>><<set $phase to 0>><</link>><<ggheat>>
<br>
<<link [[Wear the costume over underwear|Photo High Suit 2]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>><<exhibitionist1>><<gheat>>
<br>
<<if hasSexStat("exhibitionism", 3)>>
	<<link [[Wear the costume over nothing at all|Photo High Suit 2]]>><<set $phase to 2>><</link>><<exhibitionist3>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Photo High Suit 2
<<effects>>

<<if $phase is 0>>
	You step into the costume, and pull it over your shoulders until just your face is visible. It feels stuffy already.
	<br><br>
<<elseif $phase is 1>>
	<<undressmid "photo_high_suit">>
	<<if $worn.under_lower.type.includes("naked")>>
		<<if $player.gender_appearance is "f">>
			<<underlowerwear "plain panties">>
		<<else>>
			<<underlowerwear "briefs">>
		<</if>>
		<<if $worn.under_upper.type.includes("naked") and $player.gender_appearance is "f">>
			<<underupperwear "plain bra">>
		<</if>>
		You undress, grab some underwear from the rack, and step into the costume.
	<<else>>
		<<if $worn.under_upper.type.includes("naked") and $player.gender_appearance is "f">>
			<<underupperwear "plain bra">>
			You undress, grab some underwear from the rack, and step into the costume.
		<</if>>
	<</if>>

	You pull it over your shoulders, until just your face is visible. It's stuffy even with just underwear beneath.
	<<exhibitionism1>>
<<else>>
	<<undressclothes "photo_high_suit">>
	You remove your clothing, and step into the suit. You pull it over your shoulders, until just your face is visible.
	<<exhibitionism3>>
<</if>>
<<handheldundress "photo_high_suit">>
<<wearProp "flyers">>
<<wearBorrowedKaiju>>
Once the costume is on, you leave the shop.
<br><br>

<<set $specialClothesEvents.pushUnique("kaiju")>><<print specialClothesUnlock("set", "kaiju", 3)>>

<<link [[Next|Photo High Suit 3]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Photo High Suit 3
<<effects>>

You find Niki waiting for you. <<He>> nods, then gestures at a stack of flyers. "Just hand those out, and direct people to the shop. I'll follow along and snap pictures. If I do my job properly you'll forget I'm here."
<br><br>

<<link [[Ask for tips|Photo High Suit Tips]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Nod|Photo High Suit Start]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Photo High Suit Tips
<<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>

<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
	"Is there anything I should know before I start?" you ask.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
	"What should I do?" you ask.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"Just tell me what you need me to do," you say.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"Do you have any advice before I start?" you ask.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"Any tips before I get started?" you ask.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"You've done this before, right?" you ask. "Give me a few tips."
<<else>>
	"Do you have any tips for me?" you ask.
<</if>>
<br><br>

"You want to get people's <span class="green">interest</span>," Niki says. "But unless you know how to handle yourself, too much <span class="red">attention</span> will be trouble. Move to another part of the street before it gets dangerous."
<br><br>

<<He>> looks at the sky. "Take a rest when you need to. It'll be tempting to push yourself, get more done, but don't overdo it. That's a stuffy suit at the coolest of times."
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Photo High Suit Start]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Photo High Suit Start
<<effects>>

You take a stack of flyers, pinching them between the thick fingers of the costume. As you adjust your grip, Niki's camera clicks behind you.
<<wearProp "flyers">>
<br><br>
<<endevent>>

