:: Photo High Flyer
<<effects>>

You offer flyers to people as they pass, calling out the location of the games shop when someone looks your way.
<<set $photo_flyers += 3>>
<<wearProp "flyers">>
<br><br>

<<if $pleasure gte $pleasuremax>>
	The arousal within you builds, until it's too much. <<orgasm>>
	<br><br>

	Your knees give way, and you stay there until the pleasure passes. When you look up, several people have stopped to watch. Some look amused, while others leer openly.<<gggattention>><<photo_attention 3>>
	<br><br>

	You push yourself to your feet and hurry along.
	<br><br>
<</if>>

