:: Photo High Walk
<<effects>>

<<if $photo_location is 7>>
	You arrive at the top of a hill. Several people take photos of themselves or others, catching the good view of the coast in the background. Others pass through, to or from the popular tourist spots nearer the sea.
<<elseif $photo_location is 6>>
	You arrive at a statue, towering above a public square. People walk through, or stop to sit on the benches.
<<elseif $photo_location is 5>>
	You arrive at the main bus stop on the High Street. Buses pull in often, and groups of passengers step onto the pavement.
<<elseif $photo_location is 4>>
	You arrive outside the games shop you're working for. It's a good location, right in the middle of the High Street.
<<elseif $photo_location is 3>>
	You arrive outside the shopping centre. A constant flow of people enter and exit the wide doors.
<<elseif $photo_location is 2>>
	You arrive at a popular entrance to the park. Two trees guard the path, one on each side, their branches creating an arch above.
<<else>>
	You arrive at the end of the High Street. Across the road, the forest begins where the town ends. Most of the nearby shops sell outdoor equipment or forest souvenirs.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if $pleasure gte $pleasuremax>>
	The arousal within you builds, until it's too much. <<orgasm>>
	<br><br>

