:: Photo High End
<<effects>>

<<overruined true>>
<<storeon "photo_high_suit">>
<<if $phase is 1>>
	You get dressed, then leave the shop. Niki waits for you outside.
<<else>>
	You return to the games shop, head to the backroom, and remove your costume. Niki waits for you outside the shop.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<npc Niki>><<person1>>
<<photo_high_calc>>

<<if _photo_money gte 1200>>
	<span class="green">"You got people talking about this place," Niki says. "Here's your cut, well-earned."</span>
<<elseif _photo_money gte 900>>
	<span class="teal">"You've a knack for this," Niki says. "Here's your cut."</span>
<<elseif _photo_money gte 600>>
	<span class="lblue">"Like clockwork," Niki says. "Here you go."</span>
<<elseif _photo_money gte 300>>
	<span class="blue">"Nice work," Niki says. "They'll want us back for sure."</span>
<<elseif _photo_money gte 100>>
	<span class="purple">"Not bad," Niki says. "Here's your cut."</span>
<<elseif _photo_money gte 1>>
	<span class="pink">"Could've been better," Niki says. "Made some money anyway. Here's yours."</span>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">"Didn't go too well," Niki says. "But it can always be worse."</span>
<</if>>
<br><br>

Niki hands you <<moneyGain _photo_money>>.
<<famemodel _photo_fame "pic">>
<br><br>

"I'm heading back to the studio if you'd like a lift."
<br><br>

