:: Photo High End Studio Smalltalk
<<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>

<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
	"Do you do jobs like this often?" you ask after the car has been moving for a while.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
	"Was I alright today?" you ask.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"Did I do what you needed?" you ask.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"Do you work with that shop often?" you ask.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"I think that went well," you say. "Do you get many jobs like that?"
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"You get any good photos, or was I doing all the work?" you ask.
<<else>>
	"Do you get jobs like that often?" you ask.
<</if>>
<br><br>

Niki gives short answers while <<he>> drives, keeping <<his>> eyes on the road. The conversation lasts until you reach the studio.
<br><br>

You climb from the car and follow Niki inside.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Photo]]>><<photo_unset>><<endevent>><</link>>
