:: Photo High Exhibitionism Sneak
<<effects>>

<<switch $photo_location>>
	<<case 6>>
		A slow-moving lorry drives by, bearing the logo of a fishing company on its side. It hugs the wall, leaving enough space for you to sidle along with it, and stay out of prying eyes.
	<<case 5>>
		You crawl beneath the low benches along the side of the square.
	<<case 4>>
		You sneak through the alleys, peeking around each corner before exposing yourself to new angles.
	<<case 3>>
		Parked cars are packed together here. You crawl beneath them, waiting for any pedestrians to pass before darting from one vehicle to the next.
	<<case 2>>
		A small, green lane runs by the street. You hurry along it. It would be pleasant, if not for the circumstances, and the fear of someone else appearing behind or ahead.
	<<default>>
