The gang drag you down the alley, kick open a metal door, and shove you inside.
<br><br>

Your eyes adjust to the dim interior. There's a mattress on the floor, with a tripod camera pointed at it.
<br><br>

"Here's what's going to happen," the <<person1>><<person>> says, shutting the door behind <<him>>. "You're going to give us a little performance. Play along, and we won't have to hurt you. So what will it be?"
