<<if $worn.lower.type.includes("naked") and !$worn.under_lower.type.includes("lower_covering")>>
	<<link [[Next|Photo High Exhibitionism]]>><<endevent>><<photo_pass 2>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<link [[Next|Photo High Return]]>><<endevent>><<photo_pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<br>

:: Photo High Danger Nod
<<effects>>

You nod. "I'll get back to work," Niki says. "Be careful."
<br><br>

<<endevent>>
<<photo_high_options>>

:: Photo High Danger Silent
<<effects>>

You remain silent. Niki nods, as if taking it as affirmation. "I'll get back to work. Be careful."
<br><br>

<<endevent>>
<<photo_high_options>>

:: Photo High Danger Early
<<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>

<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
	"I don't want to stay out here," you say. "I want to stop."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
	"I'm sorry," you say. "I can't keep working today."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"I'm sorry," you say. "I tried, but I want to go back."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"I think I'd rather stop for today," you say.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"I'm done for today," you say. "I've had enough."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"I'm done," you say. "I'm not giving them another chance."
<<else>>
	"I'd like to stop for today," you say.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if $photo_timer lte 0>>
	"We're just about done for the day anyway," Niki says. "I'll wait for you outside."
	<br><br>
<<else>>
	"I understand," Niki says. "I'll wait for you outside."
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<endevent>>
<<link [[Next|Photo High End]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
<br>

:: Photo High Niki
<<effects>>

<<npc Niki>><<person1>>
You look along the street for Niki, checking the nearby benches and shop fronts.

<<if $photo_location is 1>>
	You find <<him>> leaning against a tree.
<<elseif $photo_location is 2>>
	You find <<him>> sitting on a bench.
<<elseif $photo_location is 3>>
	You find <<him>> stood apart from the crowd, watching you through <<his>> camera.
<<elseif $photo_location is 4>>
	You notice <<him>> circling you, snapping pictures from different angles.
<<elseif $photo_location is 5>>
	You find <<him>> stood in the street, in plain sight.
<<elseif $photo_location is 6>>
	You find <<him>> examining the shadow cast by a statue.
<<else>>
	You find <<him>> stood further down the hill.
<</if>>
You approach.
<br><br>

"What's up?" <<he>> asks.
<br><br>

<<link [[Return to work|Photo High Niki Return]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Ask how things are going|Photo High Niki Assess]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Ask how <<he>> remains hidden in plain sight|Photo High Niki Hidden]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Stop early|Photo High Niki Stop]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Photo High Niki Assess
<<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>

<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
	"How am I doing?" you ask.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile")>>
	"Am I doing alright?" you ask.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"How are things going so far?" you ask.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"How's the job looking?" you ask.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"So, how much money am I making us?" you ask.
<<else>>
	"How are things going?" you ask.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<photo_high_money_calc>>
<<if _photo_money gte 1200>>
	<span class="green">"You're on everybody's lips,"</span> Niki says, gesturing up and down the street. "We'll make good money."
<<elseif _photo_money gte 900>>
	<span class="teal">"You've given many people a memorable experience,"</span> Niki says. "The games shop should be appreciative."
<<elseif _photo_money gte 600>>
	<span class="lblue">"You're doing well,"</span> Niki says. "The games shop couldn't reasonably hope for better."
<<elseif _photo_money gte 300>>
	<span class="blue">"Not bad,"</span> Niki says. "You're sure to have driven up sales."
<<elseif _photo_money gte 100>>
	<span class="purple">"Could be better,"</span> Niki says. "You've got some talking, at least."
<<elseif _photo_money gte 1>>
	<span class="pink">"We might have sent one or two to the games shop,"</span> Niki says. "Not enough, yet."
<<else>>
	<span class="red">"We've yet to make a splash,"</span> Niki says.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Return to work|Photo High Niki Return]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Ask how <<he>> remains hidden in plain sight|Photo High Niki Hidden]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Stop early|Photo High Niki Stop]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Photo High Niki Hidden
<<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>

<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
	"How do you keep taking pictures without anyone noticing you?" you ask.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile")>>
	"Can I ask how you stay out of sight so well?" you ask.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"How do you manage to stay unnoticed out here?" you ask.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"How are you hiding in plain sight like that?" you ask.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"How do you keep disappearing every time I look for you?" you ask.
<<else>>
	"How do you stay hidden in plain sight?" you ask.
<</if>>
<br><br>

Niki smiles. "Trade secret."
<br><br>

<<link [[Return to work|Photo High Niki Return]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Ask how things are going|Photo High Niki Assess]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Stop early|Photo High Niki Stop]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Photo High Niki Stop
<<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>

<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
	"Can we stop now?" you ask.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
	"Sorry, but I'd like to stop early," you say.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"I think I need to stop," you say. "Is that alright?"
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"I'd like to finish early today, if that's alright," you say.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"I'm calling it early," you say. "I've done enough for today."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"I'm done for today," you say. "Let's head back."
<<else>>
	"I'd like to stop early," you say.
<</if>>
<br><br>

Niki checks <<his>> watch. "Alright."
<br><br>

You walk back to the games shop with Niki. <<He>> slows down so you can keep up in the bulky costume.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Photo High End]]>><<endevent>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
